        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Pocky & Rocky Reshrined follows the adventures of a young Shinto shrine maiden named Pocky and her companion, Rocky the raccoon, as they take on the Nopino Goblins!\n\nA third sequel in the series, Pocky & Rocky Reshrined is currently being developed by Tengo Project and expected for release on PlayStation 4 and Nintendo Switch in the second half of 2021. Tengo Project consists of staff who worked on the original, as well as Wild Guns: Reloaded and Ninja Saviors: Return of the Warriors.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Pocky & Rocky Reshrined sigue las aventuras de una joven sacerdotisa de un santuario sintoísta llamada Pocky y su compañero, Rocky el mapache, mientras se enfrentan a los duendes Nopino.\n\nTercera secuela de la serie, Pocky & Rocky Reshrined está siendo desarrollado actualmente por Tengo Project, y se espera su lanzamiento para PlayStation 4 y Nintendo Switch en la segunda mitad de 2021. Tengo Project está formado por personal que trabajó en el original, así como en Wild Guns: Reloaded y Ninja Saviors: Return of the Warriors.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2022",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
